--- !u!114 &963039501
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 963039499}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8a6828637c11124c9c0472321e9dcb3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScript
  dialogueText: {fileID: 10722803}
  lines:
  - 'Detective: Good morning officer, what brings you here?'
  - "Cop: Oh detective Hughes! Thank God you\u2019re here, I was about to call you."
  - 'Detective: Why? What happened?'
  - "Cop: Well, three corpses have been reported today. All murder cases. Right now,
    we\u2019re investigating the case of Mia, a 5-year-old girl."
  - "She\u2019s been found buried here behind the playground."
  - 'Detective: Do you have any leads?'
  - "Cop: Yes, we\u2019ve got a suspect. He\u2019s a 33-year-old male named Jeff
    who has been accused of trying to get close to the kids around this park on several
    occasions."
  - Coincidentally, the day of the murder, which was three days ago, he was also
    at the park and even tried to give candy to the victim.
  - 'Detective: Can I interrogate him?'
  - "Cop: Of course, he\u2019s over there."
  - "*Mia\u2019s profile has been added to your victims folder*."
  textSpeed: 0.05
